{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Red Letter Advisor evaluation set. `expect.theme` may be a string or an array of acceptable themes. Each question is scored by scripts/eval.js against a running server (/api/chat). `expect.citations`: min2 = at least two verified red-letter quotations; max1 = at most one (boundary/greeting/hostile replies offer one open door); any = no count assertion. `expect.theme` = at least one quotation must belong to that curated theme. `expect.citesAny` = at least one quotation must overlap one of the listed references. `expect.crisis` / `expect.danger` = the safety handoff must be present in the letter. `expect.status` = expected HTTP status for malformed input.",
